  "title": "Wabtec Secures Multiple Pantograph Orders in India",
  "summary": "BANGALORE – March 13, 2026 — Wabtec Corporation (NYSE: WAB) today announced it has secured multiple contracts to supply more than 680 pantographs for six major commuter rail and metro projects across India. The advanced pantograph systems will improve overall fleet availability for the projects providing more reliable, efficient, and sustainable rail operations.",
